# visibility.cyr -- the distlib bundle's visibility directive.
#
# `cyrius distlib` concatenates the [lib] modules into ONE file, dist/hisab.cyr, and a
# `private` line in a file makes everything in it file-private except what carries
# `public` (cyrius-guide, Visibility). This module is that line. It is FIRST in [lib] so
# that a toolchain older than 6.6.5 -- where the marker covered only what followed it --
# still sees it ahead of every declaration.
#
# The suites include src/*.cyr one file at a time and never include this file, so they
# keep white-box access to module internals. scripts/check-public-surface.sh flips every
# module `private` in a scratch copy to prove that no module reaches another's internals,
# and checks that the shipped bundle exposes exactly the public surface.
private
